      "writtenOn": "2024-04-10T08:57:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we really need to introduce new host command just for template migration? Is it possible to return template in new format, when biod requests that? I mean, we can always download encrypted template from FPMCU, even when it was not matched. So from biod perspective it could be loading template and downloading it if it uses old format.",
