        "id": 1520327
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-11T06:51:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added more details in the commit message, but more can be checked in go/fp-login-migration. Basically we don\u0027t trust the match secret of the old template, so we need to regenerate it. \n\nPlus the fact that they\u0027re encrypted differently. Without a special command, if I want to upload a template into nonce session it needs to be decryptable by the LabelSeed, which is not used for legacy templates.\n\nThis special command performs the 2 things we need together.",
